~C. Question and answer.#No question-and-answer format appears. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~D. Comparison of two gardens.#Only one garden is discussed. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}

